  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{HCl}$ and $\\mathrm{KNO}_{3}$ both are strong electrolyte but $\\mathrm{HCl}$ have aqueous component $\\mathrm{H}^{+}$, which has highest conductivity. $\\therefore \\mathrm{HCl}$ will have highest conductivity."
